# A naga shaman in the naga's story (mod-murloc-naga, tools/naga/), after its start was checked: at Rethress
# Sanctum in Azshara, in the naga's phase alone (2048: no world); chapter 1's first quest (a kill); Isshara's song
# takes it into her memory (memory A's bit alone, 2, at the Ravencrest Monument), where it dies (alive again at the
# pool, the memory's quest started over: one kill again shows 1 of 2), goes back in through her gossip, finishes
# the quest and wakes at the pool; her question (a quiz: a wrong answer asks again, the right one is the credit),
# handed in to Vyssa (the retired camp's, her entry kept); at Valormok, a Horde quest closed to it (the naga's gate).
# Chapter 1 is a stub (tools/naga/ch1_stub.py): its writer replaces these steps with the chapter's own.
# Written with the story's names; tools/build_data.py writes warcraft/server/murloc_naga_naga.steps with their ids.
wait 3
cmd .gps
has Rethress Sanctum
expect Phase: 2048
talk {ch1:matron}
has quest {ch1:ch1_chores}:
accept {ch1:matron} {ch1:ch1_chores}
kill {ch1:clawling}
kill {ch1:clawling}
kill {ch1:clawling}
expect complete {ch1:ch1_chores}
talk {ch1:matron}
reward {ch1:matron} {ch1:ch1_chores}
expect rewarded {ch1:ch1_chores}
# Into the memory: the song, the fade, the Ravencrest Monument; memory A's bit alone.
talk {ch0:isshara}
has quest {ch1:ch1_song}:
accept {ch0:isshara} {ch1:ch1_song}
wait 6
expect teleported
cmd .gps
has Ravencrest Monument
has Phase: 2
expect-not Phase: 20
kill {ch1:felguard}
expect credit {ch1:ch1_song} {ch1:felguard} 1/2
# A death inside: alive at the pool, the present again, the quest started over.
target self
cmd .die
wait 6
expect teleported
cmd .gps
has Rethress Sanctum
expect Phase: 2048
# Back in through the singer; one kill is 1 of 2 again; the second ends the memory (awake at the pool).
talk {ch0:isshara}
select {ch0:isshara} Sing it again
wait 6
expect teleported
kill {ch1:felguard}
expect credit {ch1:ch1_song} {ch1:felguard} 1/2
kill {ch1:felguard}
expect credit {ch1:ch1_song} {ch1:felguard} 2/2
wait 8
expect teleported
cmd .gps
has Rethress Sanctum
expect Phase: 2048
talk {ch0:isshara}
reward {ch0:isshara} {ch1:ch1_song}
expect rewarded {ch1:ch1_song}
# Her question: a wrong answer, the question again; the right one, the credit. Vyssa takes it.
talk {ch0:isshara}
has quest {ch1:ch1_question}:
accept {ch0:isshara} {ch1:ch1_question}
talk {ch0:isshara}
select {ch0:isshara} Ask me what I saw
expect option: (Stub.) Fire
select {ch0:isshara} The Empress
expect option: (Stub.) Fire
select {ch0:isshara} Fire, and the Well
expect complete {ch1:ch1_question}
talk {ch0:vyssa}
reward {ch0:vyssa} {ch1:ch1_question}
expect rewarded {ch1:ch1_question}
# The gate: Jediga at Valormok (the world's and the naga's phase there) offers a naga of level 45 none of the Horde's
# quests (Stealing Knowledge, 3517, open to every race) while its story isn't done.
cmd .levelup 35
go 1 3603.0 -4421.0 113.0
wait 3
talk 8587
expect-not quest 3517:
